SUMMARY:Deadline: OASis Bom Dia Residency 2027 at Cultivamos Cultura (Sao L
 uis\, Portugal)
DESCRIPTION:Cultivamos Cultura in Sao Luis (Odemira\, Portugal) hosts the B
 om Dia residency as part of the European OASis project: one proposal is se
 lected for a 7-to-30-day residency during March 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Cul
 tivamos Cultura (European OASis project)\nLocation: Sao Luis\, Odemira\, P
 ortugal. Open to international applicants.\nAward: EUR 1\,300 project fee\
 , travel budget up to EUR 500\, production and material expenses up to EUR
  1\,600 (pre-approved)\, food per diem\, plus free accommodation in a priv
 ate room in a shared farmhouse and access to a workspace or studio and all
  Cultivamos Cultura spaces and resources.\nDuration: 7 to 30 days during M
 arch 2027.\n\nMore: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf_PzJ3DgPiR8
 eVotOM0WqkCF2kebzzfkSjOZkvX6afx5xoQw/viewform?utm_source=artificialnouveau
 grantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf_PzJ3DgPiR8eVotOM0WqkCF2kebz
 zfkSjOZkvX6afx5xoQw/viewform?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
LOCATION:Sao Luis\, Odemira\, Portugal. Open to international applicants.
END:VEVENT
