SUMMARY:Deadline: HIAP: Learning Materials International Artist Residency 2
 027 (Suomenlinna\, Helsinki)
DESCRIPTION:HIAP's Learning Materials international residency hosts artists
  at HIAP Suomenlinna\, the island fortress off Helsinki\, for 90 days in S
 pring 2027 (12 April to 11 July) or Autumn 2027 (16 August to 14 November)
 .\n\nOrganisation: HIAP (Helsinki International Artist Programme)\, with K
 one Foundation\nLocation: HIAP Suomenlinna\, Helsinki\, Finland. Open to a
 rtists living and working outside Finland.\nAward: Working grant of EUR 1\
 ,350 per month (EUR 4\,050 total for 90 days) via Kone Foundation\, materi
 al budget up to EUR 750\, access budget up to EUR 1\,000\, one return trip
  covered (slow travel encouraged)\, plus accommodation and workspace. For 
 collectives\, the working grant can be paid to one individual only and the
 re is no additional travel budget.\nDuration: 90 days: Spring 2027 (12 Apr
 il to 11 July) or Autumn 2027 (16 August to 14 November).\n\nMore: https:/
 /www.hiap.fi/learning-materials-international-residency-application-form-2
 027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.hiap.fi/learning-materials-international-residency-applicat
 ion-form-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:HIAP Suomenlinna\, Helsinki\, Finland. Open to artists living and 
 working outside Finland.
END:VEVENT
