SUMMARY:Deadline: Schaufler Residency@TU Dresden 2027 (six-month art and sc
 ience residency\, Energy Cultures in Transition)
DESCRIPTION:The Schaufler Lab at TUD Dresden University of Technology\, a j
 oint project with The Schaufler Foundation\, invites applications for its 
 six-month artist-in-residence at the interface of art and science for 2027
 .\n\nOrganisation: Schaufler Lab@TU Dresden (TUD Dresden University of Tec
 hnology and The Schaufler Foundation)\nLocation: Dresden\, Germany. Studio
  on the TU Dresden campus\; on-site presence by arrangement.\nAward: Fello
 wship of EUR 3\,000 net per month for six months (EUR 18\,000)\, plus a pr
 oduction grant of up to EUR 10\,000 for a solo exhibition at the TUD Unive
 rsity Gallery in autumn 2027\, a studio on campus and help finding accommo
 dation. No application fee.\nDuration: Six months from April 2027.\n\nMore
 : https://tu-dresden.de/gsw/schauflerlab/schaufler-residency?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://tu-dresden.de/gsw/schauflerlab/schaufler-residency?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Dresden\, Germany. Studio on the TU Dresden campus\; on-site prese
 nce by arrangement.
END:VEVENT
