SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Realities in Transition RiT2 Open Call #3: Unch
 arted Grounds\, a VRChat world residency with L.E.V. Festival (EUR 10\,000
  fee plus up to EUR 15\,000 production)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 06 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nRealities in Transition (Ri
 T2)\, a Creative Europe XR cooperation project\, and host partner L.E.V. F
 estival invite artists with VR development experience to co-create a walka
 ble VRChat world conceived as a voyage\, with 5 to 7 environments\, 3 to 5
  avatars and optional NPC players\; events\, social worlds and theatre pie
 ces are not wanted.\n\nOrganisation: Realities in Transition (RiT2\, Creat
 ive Europe)\, with L.E.V. Festival\nLocation: Online residency\, with a Te
 st Lab at L.E.V. Gijon and a premiere at L.E.V. Matadero (Madrid)\, Spain.
  Check the RiT residencies page for country eligibility.\nAward: EUR 10\,0
 00 gross artist fee per selected artist (paid in three instalments) plus u
 p to EUR 15\,000 gross production budget shared among the team. No travel 
 or accommodation included. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 6 mont
 hs online\, January to June 2027\; Test Lab in May 2027\, final presentati
 on in September 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.realities-in-transition.eu/rit-
 2-open-call-3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.realities-in-transition.eu/rit-2-open-call-3/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online residency\, with a Test Lab at L.E.V. Gijon and a premiere 
 at L.E.V. Matadero (Madrid)\, Spain. Check the RiT residencies page for co
 untry eligibility.
END:VEVENT
